  "description": "[Pa!nt, a magical world where doodles come to life]\n\nAn ordinary notebook becomes the stage for a special adventure with your touch. Become the owner of 'Moony,' a small, cute octopus friend born from a drawing, and explore a puzzle world full of color and imagination!\n\n■ Change the color and the answer appears! Strategic color puzzle\n\nMoony can pass through the same color as itself, but cannot pass through different colors.\n\nUse the surrounding water buckets to change Moony's color and feel the thrilling sensation of paving the way through blocked paths.\n\n■ 60 rich stages and special gimmicks\n\n60 diverse stages await your challenge.\n\nMore than 4 special devices that move Moony or change its color add depth to the puzzle.\n\n■ Healing time to decorate your own notebook\n\nAs you clear stages, the monotonous home screen transforms into a splendid one!\n\nDress Moony in cute outfits with items acquired during gameplay to express your own personality.\n\n■ The joy of creation beyond limits\n\nWhen you need a different challenge, try 'Black and White Mode,' which relies solely on silhouette and senses!",
